  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. Halve potatoes lengthways.\n• Place on the lined oven tray, cut-side down. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Bake until golden and tender, 40-45 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a83918fdd10718af7f8572/step-b0ce91bd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• With potatoes have 10 mins remaining, grate carrot. Finely chop garlic.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot until softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in garlic, BBQ spice blend (add less if you're sensitive to heat) and tomato paste until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Cook kidney beans (including liquid) and vegetable stock until thickened, 3-4 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a83918fdd10718af7f8572/step-7e72833e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, add a drizzle of white wine vinegar, olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Just before serving add tomato and salad leaves and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a83918fdd10718af7f8572/step-e6f1e3fa.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide potato between plates.\n• Top with bean chilli. Sprinkle over shredded cheddar cheese.\n• Serve with salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a83918fdd10718af7f8572/step-5476f32c.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
